  "title": "Peanut Butter Pie XIV",
  "description": "Marshmallow cream, peanut butter, lemon juice, condensed milk, and whipped topping go into this pie 's super filling. When it 's all blended and smooth, it 's layered into a graham cracker crust alternately with sweet, hot fudge sauce. The pie is garnished with chopped nuts and frozen until ready to serve. This recipe makes two pies.",
